Manticore Columnar Library 9.0.0, the one of Manticore Search 14: the modules that
searchd of manticore14 loads from share/manticore/modules. Columnar storage,
secondary indexes, vector search (KNN) and auto embeddings (models of HuggingFace, or
the APIs of OpenAI, Voyage and Jina), each plain and for CPUs with AVX2; built for
azsupport/ports.
